+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                        Presentation Layer                         |
|                     Services / API Endpoints                      |
|                                                                   |
|   Examples:                                                       |
|   - User API                                                      |
|   - Place API                                                     |
|   - Review API                                                    |
|   - Amenity API                                                   |
+-------------------------------+----------------------------------+
                                |
                                | Uses Facade Pattern
                                v
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                         Facade Interface                          |
|                                                                   |
|   Provides one simple access point for the Presentation Layer     |
|   to communicate with the Business Logic Layer                    |
+-------------------------------+----------------------------------+
                                |
                                | Calls business operations
                                v
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                       Business Logic Layer                        |
|                          Models / Entities                        |
|                                                                   |
|   +------------+   +------------+   +------------+   +-----------+|
|   |    User    |   |   Place    |   |   Review   |   |  Amenity  ||
|   +------------+   +------------+   +------------+   +-----------+|
|                                                                   |
|   Responsibilities:                                               |
|   - Apply business rules                                          |
|   - Manage entity relationships                                   |
|   - Validate application logic                                    |
+-------------------------------+----------------------------------+
                                |
                                | Database operations
                                v
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                         Persistence Layer                         |
|                   Repositories / Database Access                  |
|                                                                   |
|   Examples:                                                       |
|   - UserRepository                                                |
|   - PlaceRepository                                               |
|   - ReviewRepository                                              |
|   - AmenityRepository                                             |
+-------------------------------+----------------------------------+
                                |
                                | Stores and retrieves data
                                v
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                              Database                             |
|                                                                   |
|   Stores users, places, reviews, amenities, and relationships     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+